%% ACTIRA — AI Workflow
flowchart TD
  S[Incident summary + IoCs + techniques] --> Q[Build retrieval query]
  Q --> H[Hybrid search BM25 + ANN RRF]
  H --> RR{Re-rank?}
  RR -->|yes| C[Cohere / lexical re-rank]
  RR -->|no| TOP[Top-k sources]
  C --> TOP
  TOP --> PROMPT[System + user prompt + sources]
  PROMPT --> LLM[Provider LLM]
  LLM --> PARSE[parse_llm_json]
  PARSE --> FILT[Filter citation_ids to valid set]
  FILT --> GS[Compute grounding_score]
  GS --> OUT[Playbook steps + metadata]
